+  # out of it; measured against the set as committed, every insertion point a
+  # one-line patch could take collides with an existing patch and none
+  # composes. `ec/tools/check_gate_arm_coverage.py`'s own comment makes the
+  # same point about the `for tool in` list, which is saturated the same way.
+  # `agent-gates-findings-frozen.patch` is the precedent for the shape, and
+  # this call sits above its `local rc=0` line rather than beside its own so
+  # the two three-line windows stay disjoint.
+  check_bank_map || rc=1
   # This function's own tool list and its `case` arms, held together before the
